  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Citizens Participation in Resource Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen partnership between institutions of higher education with an interest in natural resource governance and the transition to more sustainable societies in Indonesia. The project seeks to expand the ongoing research-based partnership between the Norwegian University of Science and Technology (NTNU) and Universitas Gadjah Mada (UGM) by involving new partners from Universitas Bangka Belitung (UBB), Universitas Nusa Cendana (UNDANA), and Politeknik Negeri Pontianak.</narrative>
  </description>
